Improves your ability to perform counterstrikes after blocks in the following ways:

Allows counterstrikes after incomplete blocks.

Increases the number of counterstrikes you can perform on a target while they're vulnerable by [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5)].

Increases the crit chance of counterstrikes by [24%, 26%, 28%, 30%, 32% (TL1-5; DEX 100)]. This increase scales with your Dexterity.
